  <page_number>115</page_number>
  <running_head>EPIGRAMMATA.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <signature>†o 3</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Lues medullas obsidet-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Turbare me tot anxium,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Ecquando curis definet?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Lis ista quando definet-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>Hinc Carnis, inde Spiritus?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Ecquando diffidentiam-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Victrix fides pessundabit?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Meam tui scientia-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Regente conscientiam,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Ecquando mens iflac mea-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>In te recumbet Vnicum?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Quod Velle me Voles, Volet?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Vitabit omne quod Vetas?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Quod appeti Vis appetet?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Quod negligi Vis negliget?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Tunc nempe quum terra loco-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Tua recepit regia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Tua tecum certissima-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Pacis fruemur gloria.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>Confpecta quando nemini,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Audita quando nemini,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Quum cogitata nemini,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Tui dabis timentibus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Vt ipfa te res comprobet,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Quam polliceris ampliter.</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Printed with long s rendered as s; the top-left corner mark and faint margin marks are show-through or stains and are not transcribed. Ornamental catchword-style mark at foot right is given as "†o 3" and may be a signature with a dagger ornament; doubtful.</notes>
